{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_40_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_40","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_40_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_40","textTraditional":"二、夏五月戊寅，公敗宋師于鄑。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_40_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_40","textTraditional":"三、秋，宋大水。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_40_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_40","textTraditional":"何以書？記災也。外災不書，此何以書？及我也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_40_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_40","textTraditional":"四、冬，王姬歸于齊。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_40_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_40","textTraditional":"何以書？過我也。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}